  <selectionEntry id="f7b3-ccaa-4d0f-b1ce" name="Frostglass Interdictors" type="unit" hidden="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint id="ef2b-3694-ee9b-5bac" type="max" field="selections" scope="roster" value="3" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="true"/></constraints><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="ccf6-18b1-868b-13bc" targetId="df1d-4be3-b832-eddc" name="Heavy Support" hidden="false" primary="true"/><categoryLink id="1bbc-c236-04da-696e" targetId="e5e4-dd08-6ce4-34b7" name="Frozen Cogs" hidden="false" primary="false"/><categoryLink id="d504-389e-6fbb-d4fb" targetId="d640-7a85-a199-c350" name="Infantry" hidden="false" primary="false"/></categoryLinks><profiles><profile id="b3d4-43be-b4e3-d659" name="Frostglass Interdictors" typeId="0cb1-7394-fb88-5322" typeName="Unit" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic name="M" typeId="8ffa-8367-2184-5557">6"</characteristic><characteristic name="T" typeId="c2bc-ad63-c63b-5cea">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Sv" typeId="f078-5176-43c6-5f6a">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="W" typeId="ecdc-11e1-15d1-5780">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ld" typeId="2bb6-cceb-9d3f-5f47">6+</characteristic><characteristic name="OC" typeId="6bb9-f7e0-3ec4-5517">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Invulnerable" typeId="fcc9-7d25-7e12-9146">—</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="7ff2-1317-15d5-bb9d" name="Adaptive Frostglass Doctrine" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">At the start of your Shooting phase select one visible enemy unit within 36" of the Frostglass Sightmaster or an active Frostglass Observer in this unit. That enemy is Designated until the end of the phase. Choose one of Fracture Solution, Glassknife Solution, or Coldfield Solution. Only one enemy and one solution may be active per unit per phase. Effects do not stack with identical buffs or debuffs.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="df28-800b-aeb8-f3cb" name="Fracture Solution" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Against a Designated VEHICLE, MONSTER, or FORTIFICATION, this unit may re-roll one Wound roll made with a heavy weapon during that Shooting phase.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="942c-138d-e5ce-ba37" name="Glassknife Solution" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Ranged heavy-weapon attacks by this unit against the Designated target gain Ignores Cover for the remainder of the Shooting phase.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="7465-e15d-1443-382c" name="Coldfield Solution" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">If one or more attacks from this unit's heavy weapons hit a Designated INFANTRY target during this Shooting phase, subtract 2" from that target's Move characteristic until the beginning of your next Shooting phase (minimum Move 1"). This effect does not stack with itself.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="b24b-bbb0-f35d-096b" name="Frostglass Stabilization" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">If this unit Remained Stationary during your Movement phase, once during its Shooting phase you may re-roll one Hit roll made by a heavy-weapon model against the Designated target. This is a unit-wide allowance, not one per gunner.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="a44d-bb41-717e-30cd" name="Observational Redundancy" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">The Sightmaster can designate targets without an Observer. If the Sightmaster is destroyed, at least one surviving Frostglass Observer is required to use Adaptive Frostglass Doctrine. Observers are boltgun-equipped models, never additional models, and cannot themselves take a heavy weapon. Multiple Observers do not grant multiple designations or stack effects.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="58f5-1953-ff96-3a00" name="Heavy Weapons Fire Discipline" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Each Interdictor has one primary ranged weapon (either its calibrated boltgun or its selected heavy weapon), and one melee weapon. Heavy weapon selection replaces the boltgun. This unit does not inherit the Wintergrave-only Unrestricted Arsenal rule.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="1b80-67c8-1723-754e" name="Leadership" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Exactly one organic Sightmaster per squad. Potential attached Character eligibility is homebrew and requires a separate Leader permission on that character's datasheet. One attached Leader maximum by default.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="bfe3-8532-5978-93ec" name="Frostglass equipment restrictions" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">{'squad_size': '5–10 models including exactly one Sightmaster', 'heavy_weapons': 'max 3 models in 5–9; max 6 models in 10; only ordinary Interdictors, never Sightmaster', 'observers': 'max 1 in 5–9; max 2 in 10; must retain boltgun', 'heavy_plus_observer': 'forbidden on same model', 'conversion': 'max one in squad, counts toward heavy limit', 'plasma': 'standard/supercharge are exclusive fire modes of one weapon', 'sightmaster': 'no heavy weapon, may replace calibrated boltgun with one specialist combi-weapon, choose blade/sword/fist', 'weapon_pattern': 'all equipment supported by certified firstborn Mk III–VIII power armor, no pattern bonuses or surcharges', 'nonstack': 'one marked target, one selected doctrine per unit per Shooting phase'}; native cross-model checks require New Recruit import verification. External validator included.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="31c8-7a18-1d28-4ff3" name="Frostglass Sightmaster" type="model" hidden="false"><constraints><constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="6652-cb3a-cb96-253f"/><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="a654-c14a-f186-0d07"/></constraints><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="28"/></costs><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="a03e-e7d9-9c49-8ebd" name="Firstborn armor pattern" hidden="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="2e0e-67b4-8c6a-818c"><constraints><constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="03da-2dd4-9505-ceff"/><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="1610-3ab0-1000-a8d0"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="2e0e-67b4-8c6a-818c" name="Mk III" type="upgrade" hidden="false"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="e43d-b304-57e1-6e48"/></constraints></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="de03-3610-2e31-1c09" name="Mk IV" type="upgrade" hidden="false"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="76ef-8443-3575-77a4"/></constraints></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="114a-98b5-44d9-39bb" name="Mk V" type="upgrade" hidden="false"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="1740-f8ee-e3ca-b9ea"/></constraints></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="f42c-5604-087e-21e7" name="Mk VI" type="upgrade" hidden="false"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="80a7-6e08-3a57-b0e8"/></constraints></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="61d0-3061-b5f5-0003" name="Mk VII" type="upgrade" hidden="false"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="f2d7-936d-2b99-3766"/></constraints></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="fa9d-6573-59a7-2434" name="Mk VIII" type="upgrade" hidden="false"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="7308-206e-2c2b-9ae9"/></constraints></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup><selectionEntryGroup id="dc88-c7fc-d575-cb83" name="Primary ranged weapon" hidden="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="166f-1cc9-1859-87fd"><constraints><constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="404f-b9d7-c9e6-81f5"/><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="3917-4a45-4e27-1c1f"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="166f-1cc9-1859-87fd" name="Calibrated boltgun" type="upgrade" hidden="false"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="b6a3-8c40-a492-a7e5"/></constraints><profiles><profile id="b85b-850a-a441-d905" name="Calibrated boltgun" hidden="false" typeId="a4f5-4674-06d7-5496" typeName="Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Range" typeId="8aa7-21a6-b6c1-50e6">30"</characteristic><characteristic name="A" typeId="1df3-e803-7074-57ce">2</characteristic><characteristic name="BS/WS" typeId="a16c-0b6c-2681-5f8f">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="846d-1dce-303c-5c75">4</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="91f2-51a2-9429-5a60">0</ch