ooting phase you may re-roll one Wound roll made by one of its heavy weapons.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="7ea0-fbec-c16a-57b0" name="Fire Lane Registry" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">At the beginning of the Shooting phase, nominate a visible enemy within 36". Until the end of that phase, one heavy weapon in the squad targeting that enemy gains Ignores Cover.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="bdef-05c4-5b89-e31a" name="Roster constraints and timing" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">5–10 total models including one Devastator Sergeant; {"heavy_per_squad": 4, "no_sergeant_heavy": true}. Per-model costs and allowances apply; native cross-model constraints pending actual New Recruit import/verification. Use the listed homebrew statistics; no battle simulations.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="539b-5f88-f2fe-2f87" name="Devastator Sergeant" type="model" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="24"/></costs><constraints><constraint id="59a7-e985-9796-a0fe" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="3448-8e7d-4e8a-b642" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraints><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="f635-488b-3bd2-2ee2" name="Armor pattern" hidden="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="86fc-a20c-6a67-b98b"><constraints><constraint id="be5f-f438-a3e1-953b" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="4379-c229-3a1d-ef5a" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="86fc-a20c-6a67-b98b" name="Mk II" type="upgra