ase re-roll one Wound roll made by a member of that unit.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="7839-4f82-0777-e94b" name="Leader attachment authorization" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">May lead ONLY these bodyguard unit types: Frozen Cogs Tactical Squad, Frozen Cogs Assault Squad, Frozen Cogs Devastator Squad, Frostline Combat Engineers, Frozen Cogs Sternguard Veterans, Frozen Cogs Vanguard Veterans, Sacred Forge Tactical Support Squad, IceBreaker Breachers. One attached Leader per bodyguard by default; designated character must be separately included in army roster, no free attached model or extra equipment quotas. Cross-check attachments in offline editor.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="16cb-7473-6e49-168b" name="Equipment and compatibility" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">homebrew character points, abilities and weapon profiles; no battle testing performed. Fixed signature weapons remain mandatory; mixed pre-Primaris Firstborn armor patterns supported within each appropriate class.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="b98b-467d-096b-8041" name="Frozen Cogs Lieutenant" type="model" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="65"/></costs><constraints><constraint id="fcd3-f29a-a73e-c6bf" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="a5f0-07d6-4b77-2b07" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraints><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="7885-dead-2746-7e65" name="Armor / pattern" hidden="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="8895-9909-6b85-c0d2"><constraints><constraint id="dc8f-96b2-ab6f-a996" type="min" value="1" field="selections" 