5b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">While leading a unit, once per battle round that unit may re-roll one Battle-shock test.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="e86b-950c-5f76-b791" name="Stand to the Wall" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Once per battle, while leading a unit on an objective, improve the unit OC by 1 total for this phase; not per model.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="b3cb-eff6-64da-5611" name="Leader attachment authorization" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">May lead ONLY these bodyguard unit types: Frozen Cogs Tactical Squad, Frozen Cogs Assault Squad, IceBreaker Breachers, Frozen Cogs Sternguard Veterans, Frozen Cogs Vanguard Veterans, Frostline Combat Engineers. One attached Leader per bodyguard by default; designated character must be separately included in army roster, no free attached model or extra equipment quotas. Cross-check attachments in offline editor.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="77b0-741f-0ae7-3747" name="Equipment and compatibility" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">homebrew character points, abilities and weapon profiles; no battle testing performed. Fixed signature weapons remain mandatory; mixed pre-Primaris Firstborn armor patterns supported within each appropriate class.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="5711-66f4-4fd3-1865" name="Frozen Cogs Siege Chaplain" type="model" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="75"/></costs><constraints><constraint id="6c65-fb1a-ea