fae" name="Machine Benediction" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">At end of your Command phase, repair up to D3 lost wounds to a friendly FROZEN COGS VEHICLE or AUTOMATA within 3"; never above starting wounds.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="32d0-5e31-0121-fc71" name="Battlefield Forge" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">While leading Engineers, once per battle round they may re-roll one task-specific repair or fortification roll.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="b05c-2df3-4a9d-835d" name="Leader attachment authorization" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">May lead ONLY these bodyguard unit types: Frostline Combat Engineers, Sacred Forge Tactical Support Squad, Frozen Cogs Devastator Squad. One attached Leader per bodyguard by default; designated character must be separately included in army roster, no free attached model or extra equipment quotas. Cross-check attachments in offline editor.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="c4e4-b073-cee2-0861" name="Equipment and compatibility" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">homebrew character points, abilities and weapon profiles; no battle testing performed. Fixed signature weapons remain mandatory; mixed pre-Primaris Firstborn armor patterns supported within each appropriate class.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="0732-5e28-21a0-a53e" name="Frozen Cogs Techmarine" type="model" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="70"/></costs><co