isruption effect on a unit being led; no stacking with a duplicate already active effect.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="9b67-36e3-6fc0-f6b5" name="Leader attachment authorization" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">May lead ONLY these bodyguard unit types: Frozen Cogs Tactical Squad, Frozen Cogs Devastator Squad, Frostglass Interdictors, Frozen Cogs Sternguard Veterans, Sacred Forge Tactical Support Squad. One attached Leader per bodyguard by default; designated character must be separately included in army roster, no free attached model or extra equipment quotas. Cross-check attachments in offline editor.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="2510-b055-c8dd-6e6d" name="Equipment and compatibility" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">homebrew character points, abilities and weapon profiles; no battle testing performed. Fixed signature weapons remain mandatory; mixed pre-Primaris Firstborn armor patterns supported within each appropriate class.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="f384-79c6-386e-ba5a" name="Frozen Cogs Signals Officer" type="model" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="70"/></costs><constraints><constraint id="f75f-47cb-88ab-173c" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="543b-02ed-1ae3-c3ad" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraints><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="4007-2a15-3e15-3e72" name="Armor / pattern" hidden="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="25ae-ca56-93f8-21d0"><constraints><constraint id="4a68-0cee-44a5-c349" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="