ristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">When leading an Assault or Vanguard unit that made a Charge move this turn, once per Fight phase re-roll one Hit roll and one Wound roll in that unit.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="2575-27c5-3f0e-87a6" name="Cohort Veteran" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">No unrelated Wolf faction abilities automatically apply.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="5289-e284-d4fa-ce23" name="Leader attachment authorization" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">May lead ONLY these bodyguard unit types: Frozen Cogs Assault Squad, Frozen Cogs Vanguard Veterans, IceBreaker Breachers. One attached Leader per bodyguard by default; designated character must be separately included in army roster, no free attached model or extra equipment quotas. Cross-check attachments in offline editor.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="9041-7a8d-0bff-75f3" name="Equipment and compatibility" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">homebrew character points, abilities and weapon profiles; no battle testing performed. Fixed signature weapons remain mandatory; mixed pre-Primaris Firstborn armor patterns supported within each appropriate class.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="8f46-e820-90a9-c4b5" name="Ulbral Gorborn" type="model" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="125"/></costs><constraints><constraint id="2eda-963f-77a9-9967" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="7d45-1766-f3b0-b73b" type="max" value="1" field="selections" 