a VEHICLE or FORTIFICATION.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="a9fd-aad0-7832-0992" name="Siege Anchor" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">No passive stacked invulnerable bonuses.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="6aa2-7dd4-0e54-4a01" name="Leader attachment authorization" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">May lead ONLY these bodyguard unit types: Wintergrave Siege Terminators, IceBreaker Terminators, Frosthammer Terminators, Winterguard Terminators. One attached Leader per bodyguard by default; designated character must be separately included in army roster, no free attached model or extra equipment quotas. Cross-check attachments in offline editor.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="e5da-ea34-8155-1c3c" name="Equipment and compatibility" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">homebrew character points, abilities and weapon profiles; no battle testing performed. Fixed signature weapons remain mandatory; mixed pre-Primaris Firstborn armor patterns supported within each appropriate class.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="73bd-971f-0c43-93e4" name="Attrax the Shatterer" type="model" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="155"/></costs><constraints><constraint id="bea4-4e3f-74c7-d800" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="0e0f-df61-61ba-ab17" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraints><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="3370-3c69-fa54-2dff" name="Armor / pattern" hidden="false" defaultSelectio