/characteristic><characteristic name="W" typeId="ecdc-11e1-15d1-5780">10</characteristic><characteristic name="Ld" typeId="2bb6-cceb-9d3f-5f47">6+</characteristic><characteristic name="OC" typeId="6bb9-f7e0-3ec4-5517">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Invulnerable" typeId="fcc9-7d25-7e12-9146">5+</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="6e41-ce4c-4264-55e2" name="Battleline Anchor" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">If a friendly Frozen Cogs Battleline Infantry unit is within 6", one nearby friendly unit may re-roll one Battle-shock test once per battle round .</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="14c5-8674-87c2-0e1e" name="Squad size / designation" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">1–1 model(s) per unit. Base 170 points/model; selected options are additional. Living Astartes remains part of the fixed inducted 1,200.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="af75-c5f0-0eb1-fca0" name="Engineering and command compatibility" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">No mandatory Techmarine. Friendly tech specialists may interact via explicitly stated repair abilities. No ordinary attached Infantry Leader. Not an Infernal Warrior; no serum FNP, healing or extra wound.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="3c11-f493-df59-b62c" name="Roster guidance" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">All unapproved points, weapon profiles, new titles and numeric abilities remain homebrew until full faction roster is built and balance tested. New Recruit native import not yet verified.</char