passengers disembark before this model moves, one eligible disembarked unit may reroll one ranged Hit roll against a target this vehicle hit earlier that phase .</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="79c6-4c19-047f-0303" name="Transport capacity and permitted passengers" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Carry up to 6 infantry spaces. A standard non-Jump Pack Firstborn infantry model occupies 1 space. Terminator models are not permitted. Every attached Leader occupies space as appropriate. Dreadnoughts, vehicles, automata, jetbikes, aircraft, non-Frozen-Cogs allies unless separate alliance transport rule permits them. Capacity counts every carried model, including attached Leaders. No dedicated transport carries enemy units.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="718e-0d97-3bda-53bb" name="Chassis role" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Gun-escorted infantry transport; assignment: 4th Mechanized / 6th Reserve</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="75e7-fcdf-7f31-68b6" name="Roster status" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">New weapon profiles, transport limits and special rules are homebrew homebrew design, not verified official datasheet. No balance simulations or native New Recruit import verification.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="d030-2daa-d6ce-072d" name="Razorback" type="model" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="105"/></costs><constraints><constraint id="f7d8-129d-51ee-9148" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="911a-7d6a-2e3f-67c6" ty