den="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">When this model shoots an enemy on an objective, one flame weapon rerolls a single attack-count die .</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="e4a3-d808-9287-3ab1" name="Transport capacity and permitted passengers" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Carry up to 12 infantry spaces. A standard non-Jump Pack Firstborn infantry model occupies 1 space. A Terminator-armored model occupies 2 spaces. Every attached Leader occupies space as appropriate. Dreadnoughts, vehicles, automata, jetbikes, aircraft, non-Frozen-Cogs allies unless separate alliance transport rule permits them. Capacity counts every carried model, including attached Leaders. No dedicated transport carries enemy units.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="4927-e3de-2cfd-6093" name="Chassis role" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Flame-clearing assault carrier; assignment: 5th Boarding / 2nd Siege Assault</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="76a5-c437-3ef2-a32b" name="Roster status" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">New weapon profiles, transport limits and special rules are homebrew homebrew design, not verified official datasheet. No balance simulations or native New Recruit import verification.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="0703-6219-3b7e-a68c" name="Land Raider Redeemer" type="model" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="255"/></costs><constraints><constraint id="c3fc-c83a-170b-38f6" type