-5ffa" value="15"/></costs><profiles><profile id="8525-05e5-7d41-7527" name="Selected configuration" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Once per battle reduce the Damage of one attack allocated to this vehicle by 1, minimum 1 .</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="29e4-5cbc-8656-b4fc" name="Additional tracked armor" type="upgrade" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="15"/></costs><profiles><profile id="b20c-1a72-a049-e10a" name="Selected configuration" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Once per battle reduce one unsaved attack Damage by 1, minimum 1 .</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup></selectionEntryGroups></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="d74d-ce22-cb53-48f5" name="Frozen Cogs Spartan Assault Tank" type="unit" hidden="false" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="9894-97e7-223c-aa6e" name="Armored Transports" targetId="5b89-f231-abc9-9294" hidden="false" primary="true"/><categoryLink id="e7ab-1638-5ea4-1af0" name="Frozen Cogs" targetId="e5e4-dd08-6ce4-34b7" hidden="false" primary="false"/></categoryLinks><constraints><constraint id="8e52-8939-6d0a-01ca" type="max" value="3" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="true"/></constraints><profiles><profile id="3beb-f268-aac5-acc6" name="Frozen Cogs Spartan Assault Tank" hidden="false" typeId="0cb1-7394-fb88-5322" typeName="Unit"><characteristics><characteristic name="M" typeId="8ffa-8367-2184-5557">10"</characteristic><characteristic name="T" typeId="c2bc-ad63-c63b-5cea">12</characteristic><characteristic name="Sv" typeId="f078-5176-43c6-5f6a">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="W" typeId="ecdc-11e1-15d1-5780">20</characteristic><characteristic name="Ld" typeId="2bb6-cceb-9d3f-5f47">6+</characteristic><characteristic name="OC" typeId="6bb9-f7e0-3ec4-5517">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Invulnerable" typeId="fcc9-7d25-7e12-9146">—</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="b472-71d6-413c-52d4" name="Grand Assault Ramp" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Passengers may charge after disembarking following this model’s Normal Move (homebrew).</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="f63e-b356-0d02-647a" name="Transported Siege-Brotherhood" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Once per battle after the first squad disembarks, one such unit may reroll a Charge roll this turn .</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="7269-ad65-0ac4-5057" name="Transport capacity and permitted passengers" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Carry up to 26 infantry spaces. A standard non-Jump Pack Firstborn infantry model occupies 1 space. A Terminator-armored model occupies 2 spaces. Every attached Leader occupies space as appropriate. Dreadnoughts, vehicles, automata, jetbikes, aircraft, non-Frozen-Cogs allies unless separate alliance transport rule permits them. Capacity counts every carried model, including attached Leaders. No dedicated transport carries enemy units.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="a035-442d-5103-6685" name="Chassis role" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Heavy Terminator assault delivery; assignment: 1st Ancient Brotherhood / 2nd Siege Assault</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="a3ee-79f2-0a01-8736" name="Roster status" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">New weapon profiles, transport limits and special rules are homebrew homebrew design, not verified official datasheet. No balance simulations or native New Recruit import verification.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="b334-7063-35d9-b49a" name="Spartan Assault Tank" type="model" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="320"/></costs><constraints><constraint id="ba09-7dac-73af-8bca" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="2ebf-896d-16a2-f087" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraints><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="7895-b633-7a5c-7236" name="Quad-las arrays" hidden="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="f94b-ae48-9ff2-410c"><constraints><constraint id="a7fa-6012-604f-63b7" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="bee5-c348-d974-51ba" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="f94b-ae48-9ff2-410c" name="Two quad lascannon arrays" type="upgrade" hidden="false"><profiles><profile id="4bb8-31e1-457c-22a0" name="Two quad lascannon arrays" hidden="false" typeId="a4f5-4674-06d7-5496" typeName="Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Range" typeId="8aa7-21a6-b6c1-50e6">48"</characteristic><characteristic name="A" typeId="1df3-e803-7074-57ce">8</characteristic><characteristic name="BS/WS" typeId="a16c-0b6c-2681-5f8f">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="846d-1dce-303c-5c75">12</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="91f2-51a2-9429-5a60">-3</characteristic><characteristic name="D" typeId="14cd-