al fitting</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="7f8f-ca03-85b4-fed9" name="Countermeasure flare rack" type="upgrade" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="10"/></costs><profiles><profile id="e0e1-16dd-75e4-30e7" name="Equipment detail" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Once per battle against a ranged attack, reroll one failed saving throw .</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="d14f-ee47-98c4-4479" name="Iron Firewall navigation veil" type="upgrade" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="20"/></costs><profiles><profile id="70a4-5cbe-2cfc-59b2" name="Equipment detail" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Once per battle subtract 1 from one incoming ranged Hit roll .</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="a6a4-27bf-f8cd-6edb" name="Reinforced ceramite skin" type="upgrade" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="20"/></costs><profiles><profile id="3e8b-b8a0-5cd8-3d17" name="Equipment detail" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Once per battle subtract 1 Damage from an attack, minimum 1 .</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup><selectionEntryGroup id="bcf8-4094-42df-d276" name="Neural-lace flight system" hidden="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="873b-b97a-82d1-e2a3"><constraints><constraint id="dc48-30ce-b195-0107" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="edb7-1361-9bdc-e391" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="873b-b97a-82d1-e2a3" name="Standard operator neural lace" type="upgrade" hidden="false"><profiles><profile id="17af-f56f-8700-9a54" name="Equipment detail" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Approved mechanical fitting</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="a8de-0aa5-69ee-c3df" name="Cold-forge targeting logic" type="upgrade" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="15"/></costs><profiles><profile id="a141-1a1a-c491-dcae" name="Equipment detail" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Once per battle reroll one Hit roll with one selected ranged weapon .</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="6671-f755-367d-4cbc" name="Frostglass augur sweep" type="upgrade" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="15"/></costs><profiles><profile id="26d8-8a16-e5cd-b585" name="Equipment detail" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">At start of your Shooting phase designate one visible target within 18 inches; this vehicle can reroll one ranged Hit against it .</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup></selectionEntryGroups></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="5dd8-4319-3175-db79" name="Gudryn’s Thunderhawk Gunship" type="unit" hidden="false" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="cf18-c61e-5cd0-6a9f" name="Aerial Aces" targetId="b9b4-bb20-7903-f50e" hidden="false" primary="true"/><categoryLink id="553f-2e98-2880-6a26" name="Frozen Cogs" targetId="e5e4-dd08-6ce4-34b7" hidden="false" primary="false"/></categoryLinks><constraints><constraint id="9376-a2c6-1b47-d368" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="true"/></constraints><profiles><profile id="5ebf-5db1-71fa-4b5e" name="Gudryn’s Thunderhawk Gunship" hidden="false" typeId="0cb1-7394-fb88-5322" typeName="Unit"><characteristics><characteristic name="M" typeId="8ffa-8367-2184-5557">20–60"</characteristic><characteristic name="T" typeId="c2bc-ad63-c63b-5cea">12</characteristic><characteristic name="Sv" typeId="f078-5176-43c6-5f6a">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="W" typeId="ecdc-11e1-15d1-5780">22</characteristic><characteristic name="Ld" typeId="2bb6-cceb-9d3f-5f47">6+</characteristic><characteristic name="OC" typeId="6bb9-f7e0-3ec4-5517">0</characteristic><characteristic name="Invulnerable" typeId="fcc9-7d25-7e12-9146">—</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="080d-d971-1972-549a" name="Gudryn’s Exacting Approach" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Once per battle, after this Thunderhawk moves, one embarked unit that can legally disembark gains a reroll of one Hit roll that turn .</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="b8aa-53ab-3179-6efb" name="Oath of the Trusted Pilot" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Gudryn remains the only pilot Varroth will use for his personal official or unofficial transport. This entry is uniquely capped at one. Eligos is his optional co-pilot; neither is an extra infantry model.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="04e8-b355-e43f-0e21" name="Role and doctrine" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Unique ace-piloted heavy gunship; allocation: Original Hundred / Varroth personal transport assignment</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="bc3c-7b99-4618-be65" name="Transport restrictions" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Capacity 30 infantry spaces. Terminator models consume 2 spaces. No Jump Packs, automata, allied factions or embarked vehicles except stated external vehicle gantries. Separate from generic Thunderhawks; same infantry capacity. Does not grant permission to embark allied armies without an alliance transport rule.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="7f15-3e5f-579a-a5fe" name="Homebrew development status" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">All new weapons, points, capacities, arrival rules and effects are preliminary homebrew and not verified against current official 40k or native New Recruit importing.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="f396-cae2-e93e-d7cb" name="Gudryn’s Thunderhawk Gunship" type="model" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="435"/></costs><constraints><constraint id="26f4-f6ca-0c3c-ac6f" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="c6d3-9ec6-749b-8a03" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraints><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="b013-8e0c-48e2-db5e" name="Principal armament" hidden="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="9225-700e-4a6d-b3a6"><constraints><constraint id="7109-00e2-62e8-d911" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="b80b-9e4b-9339-05fc" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope=