tle subtract 1 Damage from an attack, minimum 1 .</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup></selectionEntryGroups></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="5933-daef-7db7-053e" name="Frozen Cogs Thunderhawk Transporter" type="unit" hidden="false" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="77e4-4801-50eb-c0de" name="Aircraft &amp; Gunships" targetId="237f-1a28-dc2b-753b" hidden="false" primary="true"/><categoryLink id="93da-c028-1bad-8253" name="Frozen Cogs" targetId="e5e4-dd08-6ce4-34b7" hidden="false" primary="false"/></categoryLinks><constraints><constraint id="4797-189f-d930-3636" type="max" value="3" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="true"/></constraints><profiles><profile id="b867-2aa8-7df8-046f" name="Frozen Cogs Thunderhawk Transporter" hidden="false" typeId="0cb1-7394-fb88-5322" typeName="Unit"><characteristics><characteristic name="M" typeId="8ffa-8367-2184-5557">20–60"</characteristic><characteristic name="T" typeId="c2bc-ad63-c63b-5cea">12</characteristic><characteristic name="Sv" typeId="f078-5176-43c6-5f6a">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="W" typeId="ecdc-11e1-15d1-5780">20</characteristic><characteristic name="Ld" typeId="2bb6-cceb-9d3f-5f47">6+</characteristic><characteristic name="OC" typeId="6bb9-f7e0-3ec4-5517">0</characteristic><characteristic name="Invulnerable" typeId="fcc9-7d25-7e12-9146">—</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="8c8d-288e-83a9-9bc0" name="Heavy Gantry Operations" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">External carried vehicles cannot shoot, be embarked upon, or be treated as separate active battlefield units while held on the gantry .</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="e866-28b9-0e1d-bdb9" name="No Infantry Cabins" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Vehicle transporter carries external hulls only; no infantry transport capacity. Passenger vehicles must be empty when loaded.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="88a8-1525-eaff-fc16" name="Role and doctrine" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">External tracked-vehicle airlift and mechanized insertion; allocation: Fleet Operators / 4th Mechanized</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="7b6f-2db0-7bc4-b1ef" name="Transport restrictions" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Capacity 0 infantry spaces. No Terminator passengers. Vehicle cargo options: None, One Land Raider-class hull, Two Rhino-class hulls. No Jump Packs, automata, allied factions or embarked vehicles except stated external vehicle gantries. Advisory cargo planner does not buy the transported tanks; their separate purchase and legal deployment are required.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="f37d-5c6d-7eb4-a1dc" name="Homebrew development status" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">All new weapons, points, capacities, arrival rules and effects are preliminary homebrew and not verified against current official 40k or native New Recruit importing.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="d2e5-2cd0-17c1-060f" name="Thunderhawk Transporter" type="model" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="345"/></costs><constraints><constraint id="ecc4-7bca-1b9a-ceff" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="2dee-c640-5efe