ce per battle reroll one Hit roll with one selected ranged weapon .</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="9ab3-cae3-a11d-90de" name="Frostglass augur sweep" type="upgrade" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="15"/></costs><profiles><profile id="132b-465c-95f3-6512" name="Equipment detail" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">At start of your Shooting phase designate one visible target within 18 inches; this vehicle can reroll one ranged Hit against it .</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup></selectionEntryGroups></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="f18a-bed9-a258-83b8" name="Frozen Cogs Caestus Assault Ram" type="unit" hidden="false" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="5a34-f4f1-a480-d80f" name="Aircraft &amp; Gunships" targetId="237f-1a28-dc2b-753b" hidden="false" primary="true"/><categoryLink id="bcf4-15cd-f79d-8d2c" name="Frozen Cogs" targetId="e5e4-dd08-6ce4-34b7" hidden="false" primary="false"/></categoryLinks><constraints><constraint id="548e-8688-b84d-60e6" type="max" value="3" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="true"/></constraints><profiles><profile id="084a-7610-6d4d-db05" name="Frozen Cogs Caestus Assault Ram" hidden="false" typeId="0cb1-7394-fb88-5322" typeName="Unit"><characteristics><characteristic name="M" typeId="8ffa-8367-2184-5557">20–55"</characteristic><characteristic name="T" typeId="c2bc-ad63-c63b-5cea">12</characteristic><characteristic name="Sv" typeId="f078-5176-43c6-5f6a">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="W" typeId="ecdc-11e1-15d1-5780">18</characteristic><characteristic name="Ld" typeId="2bb6-cceb-9d3f-5f47">6+</characteristic><characteristic name="OC" typeId="6bb9-f7e0-3ec4-5517">0</characteristic><characteristic name="Invulnerable" typeId="fcc9-7d25-7e12-9146">—</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="3191-ca75-49c9-9094" name="Armored Impact" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Once per battle after this model ends a Normal Move within 3 inches of an enemy-held objective, one disembarking unit may reroll one Charge roll if otherwise eligible .</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="c2e7-5a22-2f72-3235" name="Role and doctrine" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Armored boarding ram and Terminator assault insertion; allocation: 5th Boarding / 1st Ancient Brotherhood</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="ed10-f224-43e4-e04a" name="Transport restrictions" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Capacity 20 infantry spaces. Terminator models consume 2 spaces. No Jump Packs, automata, allied factions or embarked vehicles except stated external vehicle gantries. 20 infantry spaces, enough for ten Terminators absent attached Leaders. No direct permission to charge from an Airborne aircraft.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="480e-9c96-a0bd-accf" name="Homebrew development status" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">All new weapons, points, capacities, arrival rules and effects are preliminary homebrew and not verified against current official 40k or native New Recruit importing.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="dd64-75c1-3e23-853a" name="Caestus Assault Ram" type="model" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="024