Engineer Escort" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Once per game after this unit completes a Charge, its next eligible melee weapon attack gains 1 AP .</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="a3f6-7f79-4535-3f76" name="Role and formation" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Precision demolition and industrial siege cutting; 2nd Siege Assault / Forge cadres</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="0d11-cfa8-839b-acc0" name="Equipment guidance" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Homebrew. Costs, stats and new abilities are homebrew. Not balanced or New Recruit import-tested. Specialist allocation is independently checked in offline editor; native New Recruit cross-model enforcement requires an in-app check.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="75c5-5a97-067b-072b" name="Specialist allocation: gun" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">2 permitted per FULL 5 models among options: Meltagun, Flamer; checked in offline editor, native XML may not enforce the shared squad cap.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="1766-e56a-aac5-c163" name="Squad complement" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Exactly one squad lead/controller plus 4–9 squad members.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="cbb7-8080-deb2-25e3" name="Lead Artisan / Sergeant" type="model" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" 