 one repair per target per turn .</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="7e0c-1e43-3f55-d4c9" name="Disposable Machinery" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">These cyborg labor-servitors are not inducted Astartes and never receive Infernal Warriors serum abilities.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="8346-24c8-0bd2-e909" name="Role and formation" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Low-cost repair auxiliaries and utility guards; 36 Forge workforce; non-Astartes</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="5f2f-bfaf-8b17-a5b3" name="Equipment guidance" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Homebrew. Costs, stats and new abilities are homebrew. Not balanced or New Recruit import-tested. Specialist allocation is independently checked in offline editor; native New Recruit cross-model enforcement requires an in-app check.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="e0fc-0009-7b44-2e96" name="Squad complement" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Exactly one squad lead/controller plus 3–9 squad members.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="0241-71b2-c670-277d" name="Control Operator / Lead Platform" type="model" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="13"/></costs><constraints><constraint id="32a1-cc84-2626-bc80" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="dced-f7c0-e63c-b198" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraint