h to Harmonic Artisans, Winter Requiem Sonic Marines or Hushglass Disruptors; one Leader per unit unless separately authorized. Native New Recruit link not yet verified.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="2b6f-a1e7-da9f-4013" name="Role and formation" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Sonic conductor and technical specialist Leader; Harmonic Artisans / signals</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="7e87-5763-9a89-04f3" name="Equipment guidance" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Homebrew. Costs, stats and new abilities are homebrew. Not balanced or New Recruit import-tested. Specialist allocation is independently checked in offline editor; native New Recruit cross-model enforcement requires an in-app check.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="9a78-7acd-dcf9-36a5" name="Leader attachments" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Harmonic Artisans; Winter Requiem Sonic Marines; Hushglass Disruptors; requires New Recruit native attachment validation.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="dd7e-0277-8acc-2575" name="Frozen Cogs Resonance Cantor" type="model" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="90"/></costs><constraints><constraint id="f8af-a028-18a1-5634" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="b200-5396-97cc-290a" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraints><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="e808-a1f8-1985-73ee" name="Conductor weapon" hidden="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="c88c-1b06-e85e-370b"><constrai