characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">One sniper attack per shooting gains Ignores Cover </characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup></selectionEntryGroups></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="2cca-2a30-f09a-a8fe" name="Frostbound Sapper Section" type="unit" hidden="false" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="bbe8-8046-39fc-61f9" name="Frostbound Auxilia" targetId="ba92-31ee-3264-a18e" hidden="false" primary="true"/><categoryLink id="513a-1f07-16f3-1e67" name="Frozen Cogs" targetId="e5e4-dd08-6ce4-34b7" hidden="false" primary="false"/></categoryLinks><constraints><constraint id="6564-c3ab-36c1-ac27" type="max" value="3" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="true"/></constraints><profiles><profile id="0b57-e1d6-dc48-8f8f" name="Frostbound Sapper Section" hidden="false" typeId="0cb1-7394-fb88-5322" typeName="Unit"><characteristics><characteristic name="M" typeId="8ffa-8367-2184-5557">6"</characteristic><characteristic name="T" typeId="c2bc-ad63-c63b-5cea">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Sv" typeId="f078-5176-43c6-5f6a">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="W" typeId="ecdc-11e1-15d1-5780">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ld" typeId="2bb6-cceb-9d3f-5f47">7+</characteristic><characteristic name="OC" typeId="6bb9-f7e0-3ec4-5517">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Invulnerable" typeId="fcc9-7d25-7e12-9146">—</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="dd3d-97d3-01a5-d7fa" name="One Frozen Cogs Army" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">FROSTBOUND AUXILIA are mortal fighting elements of a Frozen Cogs detachment, not a separate Guard faction. They share FROZEN COGS faction allegiance. Their datasheets do not unlock Astra Militarum Orders, Platoon detachments, Guard stratagems or detachment abilities. </characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="94f2-6d88-4858-a3fc" name="Mortal Discipline" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Models with FROSTBOUND AUXILIA MORTAL keywords do NOT gain Astartes serum healing, Chapter-level Astartes Feel No Pain, neural-lace mastery, an Obliterator Masterwork, or the special armor abilities of inducted Marines. A unit receives its own printed abilities only. </characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="6f7e-631b-cd3f-b54e" name="Direct Support, Not Orders" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Attached optional Frostbound Characters provide only their datasheet abilities. No compulsory officer chain and no separate recurring Orders resource. </characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="e2d8-d798-84e8-8f1f" name="Workshop Repair Cap" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Each VEHICLE may have lost Wounds restored by only one Frozen Cogs repair source in each friendly turn; mortal medicae can affect only named eligible MORTAL INFANTRY. </characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="d3c0-d1f0-99db-6bad" name="Transport Eligibility" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Auxilia transports may carry FROSTBOUND AUXILIA INFANTRY (including eligible CHARACTERS) only. They never carry Astartes or Terminators unless a future datasheet expressly says so. </characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="9872-be73-ee2c-b884" name="Measured Demolition" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Once per turn, one demolition-gear attack against a Vehicle/Fortification may reroll one Wound roll .</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="4252-73f9-3dad-4994" name="Roster notice" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Homebrew — not official Warhammer 40,000 rules; all profiles and costs homebrew. Native New Recruit combined caps requires an in-app check. Ratio limits are checked in the offline editor; native importer not tested.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="8427-aa40-cea6-8aa0" name="Force allocation" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Siege Assault auxiliary engineer platoons — Mortal demolitions and obstacle clearance</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="08a3-3b3e-7d5d-41ba" name="Keywords" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">FROZEN COGS, FROSTBOUND AUXILIA, MORTAL, CHAOS, INFANTRY</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="b32b-94a0-a495-9442" name="Specialist cap 1" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">At most 1 per full 5 models: Pattern-IX flamer, Auxilia plasma gun, Auxilia melta gun; checked offline.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="5cb8-f221-8d5d-3651" name="Specialist cap 2" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">At most 1 per full 5 models: Demolition kit, Charge-bearing demolition rig; checked offline.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="52c0-cfef-e005-dd2c" name="Auxilia member 1" type="model" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="14"/></costs><constraints><constraint id="17ad-a2c4-b32e-030f" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="f245-3b0a-ff59-c766" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraints><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="66ee-a6c9-cbea-5eae" name="Engineer primary" hidden="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="7904-0fcd-2e8e-d523"><constraints><constraint id="cd44-be7e-9b53-c528" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="baa0-8cda-ea3f-ee5a" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="7904-0fcd-2e8e-d523" name="Frostbound pattern lascarbine" type="upgrade" hidden="false"><profiles><profile id="b5a4-1b64-b5cf-2caa" name="Frostbound pattern lascarbine" hidden="false" typeId="a4f5-4674-06d7-5496" typeName="Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Range" typeId="8aa7-21a6-b6c1-50e6">24"</characteristic><characteristic name="A" typeId="1df3-e803-7074-57ce">2</characteristic><characteristic name="BS/WS" typeId="a16c-0b6c-2681-5f8f">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="846d-1dce-303c-5c75">3</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="91f2-51a2-9429-5a60">0</characteristic><characteristic name="D" typeId="14cd-2ade-2ccc-5c11">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Traits" typeId="0f05-4353-204c-511f">Rapid Fire 1 </characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="5d44-44f7-1bac-2d1c" name="Frostbound boarding shotgun" type="upgrade" hidden="false"><profiles><profile id="d8b2-130c-6d00-df4a" name="Frostbound boarding shotgun" hidden="false" typeId="a4f5-4674-06d7-5496" typeName="Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Range" typeId="8aa7-21a6-b6c1-50e6">12"</characteristic