reroll a Charge roll .</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup></selectionEntryGroups></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="0455-a378-a795-a9b4" name="Frostbound Forge Marshal" type="unit" hidden="false" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="1c03-d2b9-c63f-47bc" name="Frostbound Auxilia" targetId="ba92-31ee-3264-a18e" hidden="false" primary="true"/><categoryLink id="3bfb-47ba-99ef-cf20" name="Frozen Cogs" targetId="e5e4-dd08-6ce4-34b7" hidden="false" primary="false"/></categoryLinks><constraints><constraint id="a89a-dad4-f17f-2630" type="max" value="3" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="true"/></constraints><profiles><profile id="4e37-ea8a-8850-1f0b" name="Frostbound Forge Marshal" hidden="false" typeId="0cb1-7394-fb88-5322" typeName="Unit"><characteristics><characteristic name="M" typeId="8ffa-8367-2184-5557">6"</characteristic><characteristic name="T" typeId="c2bc-ad63-c63b-5cea">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Sv" typeId="f078-5176-43c6-5f6a">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="W" typeId="ecdc-11e1-15d1-5780">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ld" typeId="2bb6-cceb-9d3f-5f47">6+</characteristic><characteristic name="OC" typeId="6bb9-f7e0-3ec4-5517">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Invulnerable" typeId="fcc9-7d25-7e12-9146">5+</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="6724-682a-df48-7678" name="One Frozen Cogs Army" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">FROSTBOUND AUXILIA are mortal fighting elements of a Frozen Cogs detachment, not a separate Guard faction. They share FROZEN COGS faction allegiance. Their datasheets do not unlock Astra Militarum Orders, Platoon detachments, Guard stratagems or detachment abilities. </characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="c7ac-4ac5-c1b0-4b60" name="Mortal Discipline" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Models with FROSTBOUND AUXILIA MORTAL keywords do NOT gain Astartes serum healing, Chapter-level Astartes Feel No Pain, neural-lace mastery, an Obliterator Masterwork, or the special armor abilities of inducted Marines. A unit receives its own printed abilities only. </characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="8225-0969-a74f-8a74" name="Direct Support, Not Orders" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Attached optional Frostbound Characters provide only their datasheet abilities. No compulsory officer chain and no separate recurring Orders resource. </characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="6463-5609-5eaf-ef55" name="Workshop Repair Cap" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Each VEHICLE may have lost Wounds restored by only one Frozen Cogs repair source in each friendly turn; mortal medicae can affect only named eligible MORTAL INFANTRY. </characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="719a-935c-0720-3811" name="Transport Eligibility" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Auxilia transports may carry FROSTBOUND AUXILIA INFANTRY (including eligible CHARACTERS) only. They never carry Astartes or Terminators unless a future datasheet expressly says so. </characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="4d70-a276-6bca-9a5c" name="Field Maintenance" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Repair rolls are separate from Forge engineering mastery; each friendly VEHICLE may receive at most one successful wound-restoring repair per turn across all Frozen Cogs rules .</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="8678-af6e-7a56-9d4b" name="Roster notice" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Homebrew — not official Warhammer 40,000 rules; all profiles and costs homebrew. Native New Recruit combined caps requires an in-app check. Ratio limits are checked in the offline editor; native importer not tested.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="3fb6-4839-a478-8f1a" name="Force allocation" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Sacred Forge allied workshops — Mortal repair and ordnance coordinator</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="eefb-956a-3687-28c7" name="Keywords" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">FROZEN COGS, FROSTBOUND AUXILIA, MORTAL, CHAOS, CHARACTER</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="b9f6-104a-3ac5-6ff8" name="May Lead (optional)" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Frostbound Sapper Section, Frostbound Gun Teams, Frostbound Heavy Support Section; never compulsory. Attachments are not native-validated yet.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="5223-c201-889d-47c3" name="Auxilia Commander" type="model" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="70"/></costs><constraints><constraint id="7194-18c0-dea5-6ee2" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="80cb-6744-bb04-0569" type="max" value="1" fi