93f5-f2cf" name="Workshop Repair Cap" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Each VEHICLE may have lost Wounds restored by only one Frozen Cogs repair source in each friendly turn; mortal medicae can affect only named eligible MORTAL INFANTRY. </characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="42f1-3821-42be-36a8" name="Transport Eligibility" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Auxilia transports may carry FROSTBOUND AUXILIA INFANTRY (including eligible CHARACTERS) only. They never carry Astartes or Terminators unless a future datasheet expressly says so. </characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="409b-54aa-f591-d40b" name="Assault Hatch" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">One eligible Frostbound Breach or Sapper squad Disembarking from this vehicle may reroll one Advance roll that turn .</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="392e-c564-bf05-2ac1" name="Auxilia Transport" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Standard transport capacity 10 eligible FROSTBOUND AUXILIA INFANTRY; siege workbay capacity 6. No Astartes, Terminators or Daemon Engines.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="3f2c-a798-43e8-cc8c" name="Roster notice" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Homebrew — not official Warhammer 40,000 rules; all profiles and costs homebrew. Native New Recruit combined caps requires an in-app check. Ratio limits are checked in the offline editor; native importer not tested.</characteri