 id="6d63-ed9b-e237-7d16" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="c8cd-1b91-be26-f5ff" name="Standard gunnery crew" type="upgrade" hidden="false"><profiles><profile id="0574-d5aa-e989-a9cb" name="Equipment effect" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Mortal gunners included; no extra crew selection</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="8abb-a35e-c2aa-bb3a" name="Survey predictor" type="upgrade" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="12"/></costs><profiles><profile id="5090-b9c8-ec52-041c" name="Equipment effect" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Once per battle ignore one indirect-fire accuracy penalty when a Signal Cell spots target </characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup></selectionEntryGroups></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="d9de-ba4d-8899-047d" name="Frostbound Tank Hunter" type="unit" hidden="false" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="a21b-d07b-b283-ebdf" name="Frostbound Auxilia" targetId="ba92-31ee-3264-a18e" hidden="false" primary="true"/><categoryLink id="9489-f082-e96b-c32f" name="Frozen Cogs" targetId="e5e4-dd08-6ce4-34b7" hidden="false" primary="false"/></categoryLinks><constraints><constraint id="f67c-8d3a-3a91-2be9" type="max" value="3" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="true"/></constraints><profiles><profile id="044d-b8e5-0d97-7c5c" name="Frostbound Tank Hunter" hidden="false" typeId="0cb1-7394-fb88-5322" typeName="Unit"><characteristics><characteristic name="M" typeId="8ffa-8367-2184-5557">9"</characteristic><characteristic name="T" typeId="c2bc-ad63-c63b-5cea">10</characteristic><characteristic name="Sv" typeId="f078-5176-43c6-5f6a">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="W" typeId="ecdc-11e1-15d1-5780">13</characteristic><characteristic name="Ld" typeId="2bb6-cceb-9d3f-5f47">7+</characteristic><characteristic name="OC" typeId="6bb9-f7e0-3ec4-5517">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Invulnerable" typeId="fcc9-7d25-7e12-9146">—</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="887c-9228-4d05-8fbc" name="One Frozen Cogs Army" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">FROSTBOUND AUXILIA are mortal fighting elements of a Frozen Cogs detachment, not a separate Guard faction. They share FROZEN COGS faction allegiance. Their datasheets do not unlock Astra Militarum Orders, Platoon detachments, Guard stratagems or detachment abilities. </characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="bc9b-b581-05b1-2ea7" name="Mortal Discipline" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Models with FROSTBOUND AUXILIA MORTAL keywords do NOT gain Astartes serum healing, Chapter-level Astartes Feel No Pain, neural-lace mastery, an Obliterator Masterwork, or the special armor abilities of inducted Marines. A unit receives its own printed abilities only. </characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="01a9-33e0-03b0-ccb3" name="Direct Support, Not Orders" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Attached optional Frostbound Characters provide only their datasheet abilities. No compulsory officer chain and no separate recurring Orders resource. </characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="a82b-f4d8-0a10-3a93" name="Workshop Repair Cap" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Each VEHICLE may have lost Wounds restored by only one Frozen Cogs repair source in each friendly turn; mortal medicae can affect only named eligible MORTAL INFANTRY. </characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="8586-98b7-bc0d-559e" name="Transport Eligibility" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Auxilia transports may carry FROSTBOUND AUXILIA INFANTRY (including eligible CHARACTERS) only. They never carry Astartes or Terminators unless a future datasheet expressly says so. </characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="d786-de76-bb67-d54e" name="Penetrator Calibration" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Once per Shooting phase, this vehicle rerolls one Wound against enemy VEHICLE or MONSTER .</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="f7c6-12a9-0f01-fc9a" name="Roster notice" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Homebrew — not official Warhammer 40,000 rules; all profiles and costs homebrew. Native New Recruit combined caps requires an in-app check. Ratio limits are checked in the offline editor; native importer not tested.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="7b3c-3738-2b91-e4bc" name="Force allocation" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Frostbound anti-armor motor pools — Armored long-range vehicle interdiction</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="6fff-ac70-878c-ba3d" name="Keywords" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">FROZEN COGS, FROSTBOUND AUXILIA, MORTAL, CHAOS, VEHICLE</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="2c26-4ec4-c777-8f19" name="Auxilia operator" type="model" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="165"/></costs><constraints><constraint id="375b-08eb-926d-4225" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="239f-6378-4228-f3c0" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraints><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="3fb7-9a24-a021-4f46" name="Tank destroyer main weapon" hidden="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="dc61-d491-4f59-c83d"><constraints><constraint id="795f-118f-8bde-646f" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="5168-cbc3-084c-1fdc" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="dc61-d491-4f59-c83d" name="Low-profile lascannon" type="upgrade" hidden="false"><profiles><profile id="8c69-59d0-1f2c-6ac6" name="Low-profile lascannon" hidden="false" typeId="a4f5-4674-06d7-5496" typeName="Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Range" typeId="8aa7-21a6-b6c1-50e6">48"</characteristic><characteristic name="A" typeId="1df3-e803-7074-57ce">1</characteristic><characteristic name="BS/WS" typeId="a16c-0b6c-2681-5f8f">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="846d-1dce-303c-5c75">12</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="91f2-51a2-9429-5a60">-3</characteristic><characteristic name="D" typeId="14cd-2ade-2ccc-5c11">D6+1</characteristic><characteristic name="Traits" typeId="0f05-4353-204c-511f">Heavy</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="1ce5-aad9-21d3-771c" name="Dual coldspike lances" type="upgrade" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a7