lity"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Auxilia transports may carry FROSTBOUND AUXILIA INFANTRY (including eligible CHARACTERS) only. They never carry Astartes or Terminators unless a future datasheet expressly says so. </characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="a849-d66c-c134-f306" name="Air Defense Screen" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">When targeting FLY unit, once per phase reroll one Hit . This is anti-air defense, not a guarantee of bypassing aircraft targeting restrictions.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="c80a-24a7-9f9b-d94e" name="Roster notice" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Homebrew — not official Warhammer 40,000 rules; all profiles and costs homebrew. Native New Recruit combined caps requires an in-app check. Ratio limits are checked in the offline editor; native importer not tested.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="090b-8a50-75ec-c53d" name="Force allocation" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Fleet Defense / Auxilia air defense — Mobile anti-aircraft interdiction</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="dc1c-558e-0061-2514" name="Keywords" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">FROZEN COGS, FROSTBOUND AUXILIA, MORTAL, CHAOS, VEHICLE</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="611d-bf1a-7f98-330b" name="Auxilia operator" type="model" hidden="false"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="125"/></costs><constraints><constraint id